title: "Code in Nothing (CIN-Lab): Model-Free Bounded Evolutionary Program-Synthesis Research Prototype"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
url: "https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/code-in-nothing"
repository-code: "https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/code-in-nothing"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - program-synthesis
  - evolutionary-computation
  - formal-methods
  - program-induction
  - finite-domain-verification
  - model-free-ai
abstract: >-
  Code in Nothing (CIN-Lab) is a runnable, model-free evolutionary program-synthesis
  experiment exploring typed code structures under bounded formal specifications.
  Operating without large language models or pretrained code generators, CIN-Lab uses
  deterministic grammar enumeration, finite-domain verification witnesses, adaptive
  domain mutation, and two-specification replay inheritance gates.
